# The sandbox: what it is doing now, what strict adds, and the profile table.
title lyna-tmux sandbox
size 104 30
run demo-shell
wait 1
type clear
enter
wait 0.5
type lyna-tmux sandbox status
enter
wait 2
frame 3
type clear; lyna-tmux sandbox show strict | head -40
enter
wait 2
frame 3
type clear; lyna-tmux sandbox profiles
enter
wait 2
frame 3.5
